          "type": "liquidity",
          "limit": 50000000.0,
          "unit": "usd",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "The Borrower shall not permit Liquidity, at any time, to be less than $50,000,000 (the “ Minimum Liquidity Amount ”) and on or prior to the date that is twenty (20) days following the end of each calendar month (or, if such day is not a Business Day, the next succeeding Business D"
